\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 Texte des II. Teils datiert: Text 2 1432, Text 3 1433 geschrieben. Schreiberkolophon 219r\plain \f0\i\fs16  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 Explicit liber de summo officio, quod compilavit Magister Iohanne Beleth scriptus sub Anno domini M\u176 \'b0CCCC\u176 \'b0 XXXII\u176 \'b0 Conpletus hora quinta post meridiem In sabbato ante letare. deo gratias. Si autem a quis rediens aliquanti vel ab aliquo locaveris}}\plain \f0\i\fs16 .\plain \f0\fs16  Schreiberkolophon 243v: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 Explicit summa de modo observandi quodlibet interdictum, quod compilavit Maister Marcius de Spira. Scripta in Rinvelden anno domini 1433 vel M\u176 \'b0CCCC\u176 \'b0XXXIII\u176 \'b0. Completa in 4a feria post Iudica. Orate pro me pur propter Deum.}}\plain \f0\i\fs16  \plain \f0\fs16 Sp\u228 \'e4ter im Besitz des 1618 gegr\u252 \'fcndeten {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezsoz[1].4600/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 Kapuzinerklosters Mainz}}\plain \f0\fs16 , Besitzeintrag 1r: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 Fratrum Capucinorum Moguntinensium}}}

