\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 Schreibervermerk 293v: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 et finitus est ille liber proxima feria 4ta post festum Agne post meridiem hora quasi 2a }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 [....]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17  post anno domini 1439 etc.}}\plain \f0\i\fs16 .\plain \f0\fs16  Nachtr\u228 \'e4gliche 294v Besitzvermerke des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 Johannes Dahlheim}}\plain \f0\fs16  und des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 Petrus de Maguntia}}\plain \f0\fs16 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 Item}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 (?)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17  Iohannes Dalheym est possessor huius }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 [li]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 belli. Si qui invenit, reddere!}}\plain \f0\fs16 ; darauf: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 Item Petrus Maguntie. Quis hoc infenit}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs16\chcbpat17 , reddere debet!}}\plain \f0\i\fs16  \plain \f0\fs16 (von Petrus 295r ann\u228 \'e4hernd gleichlautend wiederholt). Ein in Katzenlnbogen geborener Johannes von Dalheim unterrichtete nach  Studium in K\u246 \'f6ln und Promotion in Siena um 1498 in Heidelberg (vgl. (RAG-ID: ngCS1B577CU39ryYwBLrnAoF, https://resource.database.rag-online.org/ngCS1B577CU39ryYwBLrnAoF, 27.07.2022). Sp\u228 \'e4ter in der {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezsoz[1].4600/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs16\chcbpat17 Mainzer Kartause}}\plain \f0\fs16 , dort im 18. Jh. auf Ir die Signatur \plain \f0\i\fs16 574\plain \f0\fs16  notiert sowie \plain \f0\i\fs16 Nescio quid habeat hic liber. Rideatur et dicat alius, qui postest legere\plain \f0\fs16 .}

